{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/fdacb61aa3fabe701a9a44ca2db901df.poster.avif?t=1773446910\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/fdacb61aa3fabe701a9a44ca2db901df.webm?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/fdacb61aa3fabe701a9a44ca2db901df.mp4?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/5d628e223c8e2702009c3178b07bd1f3.poster.avif?t=1773446910\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/5d628e223c8e2702009c3178b07bd1f3.webm?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/5d628e223c8e2702009c3178b07bd1f3.mp4?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/0bfbf904723496562c5702fd2b16f2d2.poster.avif?t=1773446910\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/0bfbf904723496562c5702fd2b16f2d2.webm?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/0bfbf904723496562c5702fd2b16f2d2.mp4?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Metroidvania-style action exploration adventure game. It tells the story of a world driven by rules and gears\u2014&quot;Sky City&quot;\u2014gradually collapsing. The player takes on the role of a life form that awakens in darkness, embarking on a journey to explore the world. As the forces, emotions, wisdom, and order of the world gradually crumble, each region descends into chaos and decay. Through exploration, the small life form gradually uncovers the truth about the world and life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game, with its stylized cartoon art and profound narrative, depicts the collapse of the world and the struggle for survival. Players will explore city-like maps, interact with unique NPCs, challenge bosses, collect cards, and ultimately confront the truth of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/bdc1c6e24bd0751a14dc03e54d9bdd72.avif?t=1773446910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras_big/bdc1c6e24bd0751a14dc03e54d9bdd72.avif?t=1773446910 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Explore Vast Worlds--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse diverse and unique maps, each filled with hidden surprises and lurking dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/45b10068065935ae24808418b2a10caa.poster.avif?t=1773446910\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/45b10068065935ae24808418b2a10caa.webm?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/45b10068065935ae24808418b2a10caa.mp4?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Battle &amp; Collect--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange and fearsome creatures, defeat them to collect powerful cards, unlock unique skills, and expand your combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/23425076bbd9aa0e758cf0b954d79eec.poster.avif?t=1773446910\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/23425076bbd9aa0e758cf0b954d79eec.webm?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/23425076bbd9aa0e758cf0b954d79eec.mp4?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Customize Your Playstyle--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flexible skill-combining system lets you freely mix cards and abilities to create your own combat style and rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/3ff3a178fcc795d386f1e017ae95eb96.poster.avif?t=1773446910\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/3ff3a178fcc795d386f1e017ae95eb96.webm?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/3ff3a178fcc795d386f1e017ae95eb96.mp4?t=1773446910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/extras/d8f907226133ff6c939e7b8eaaf9cd71.poster.avif?t=1773446910\" width=